	(text "ONE-SHOT FAULT POLICY\nSTARTED retains the first start within each power epoch.\nFaults cannot restart it; full power reset CAN. Repeated source resets FAIL qualification.\nOV_N presets FAULT asynchronously. Crowbar vs eFuse deferred/open."
