				(size 1.2 1.2)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "d435024c-e150-57d1-a6d7-b11eebb52126")
	)
	(text "+12V 2.4 A / -12V 0.8 A, <=33 W together (prototype, not measured; thermal rating conditional on the\nrouting contract). 13.5-16.5 V at module; 15 V / 3 A PD (start into the full rack needs ~4.65 A for ~2.5 ms:\nacceptance test S1). Rack <=0.44 mF. No reverse-current blocking; no powered parallel supply or hotplug."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
